---
metadata:
  priority: default
  max_attempts: 3
---
{% doc %}
  A customer reply on an existing ticket. When the assignee has been away
  or off for more than a business day the ticket is re-assigned first
  (06 §2), so the reply alert reaches the new assignee and the previous one
  is told. The first message of a new ticket is covered by the "new"
  notification.
  @param {object} event - support_message_received
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  if event.auto_reply
    return null
  endif
  function _ = 'modules/support/commands/assignment/reassign_if_off', ticket_id: event.ticket_id
  graphql first = 'modules/support/messages/search', ticket_id: event.ticket_id, limit: 1
  if first.records.results.first.id == event.message_id
    return null
  endif
  function _ = 'modules/support/commands/notifications/notify', event_key: 'reply', ticket_id: event.ticket_id, actor_id: null, mentioned_ids: null
%}
